# The kubelet is a FROM-scratch container with no os-release of its own; the
# host's file is bind-mounted into it so `kubectl get nodes` reports this system
# as `osImage` rather than a bare Linux.
#
# ID_LIKE names the RHEL family on purpose: tools that key on it (some CNI and
# CSI installers) recognise the userspace the image carries.
